---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const title = 'Fun Clicker Unblocked? Play in Your Browser (No Download)';
const description =
  'Fun Clicker runs in your browser with no download. Plain notes on “unblocked” play — we do not promise school-filter bypasses or APK installs.';
---

<SiteLayout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/unblocked">
  <section class="space-y-8 border-none">
    <p class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-black">Play</a>
      <span class="mx-2">/</span>
      Unblocked
    </p>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase italic leading-none">
      Play Fun Clicker<br />in your browser.
    </h1>

    <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-loose text-gray-700 max-w-2xl">
      When people search <strong>fun clicker unblocked</strong>, they usually want a free browser game that does not
      need an install. Fun Clicker on this site loads inside a normal web page — open
      <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/#game">the play embed</a>, click, and go.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-neo-yellow neo-border p-6 shadow-brutal-sm text-black space-y-3">
      <h2 class="font-black uppercase text-lg">What “unblocked” means here</h2>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
        We mean <strong>playable in a standard browser</strong> (desktop or mobile), with no APK and no desktop
        installer. We do <strong>not</strong> claim to bypass school or workplace network filters, and we do not
        publish proxy, VPN, DNS, or “unblocker” tutorials.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-[10px] font-black uppercase">
      <a href="/#game" class="bg-black text-white neo-border px-4 py-2 shadow-brutal-sm">Play Fun Clicker</a>
      <a href="/guide/" class="bg-neo-blue neo-border px-4 py-2 shadow-brutal-sm">Tips &amp; FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-6 bg-gray-50 -mx-6 px-6 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase italic">Why browser play helps</h2>
    <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm font-medium leading-loose text-gray-700">
      <li>
        <span class="font-black uppercase text-xs block mb-1">No download</span>
        The game runs in an iframe on the homepage. You stay on HTTPS in your existing browser.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-black uppercase text-xs block mb-1">Desktop + mobile</span>
        Most modern browsers can load the embed. If taps fail on a phone, reload the frame or try another browser.
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="font-black uppercase text-xs block mb-1">Quick recovery</span>
        Use FULLSCREEN for focus and RELOAD if the embed freezes — details in the
        <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/guide/">Fun Clicker guide</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-black uppercase italic">If the game will not open</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm font-medium leading-loose text-gray-700">
      <p>
        Some networks block game hosts or third-party embeds. If the frame stays blank, try another network or browser
        when you are allowed to — that is ordinary troubleshooting, not a filter-bypass guide.
      </p>
      <p>
        We will not list mirrors, cracked clients, or APK sideloads. The supported path is the
        <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/">official play page on FunClicker.click</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white neo-border p-6 shadow-brutal-sm space-y-3">
      <h3 class="font-black uppercase text-sm">Short FAQ</h3>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600">
        <strong class="text-black">Do I need Fun Clicker APK?</strong> No — use the browser embed.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600">
        <strong class="text-black">Is this guaranteed unblocked at school?</strong> No. Network rules vary; we only
        offer a normal browser game page.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-600">
        <strong class="text-black">Same as funklicker / funclicker?</strong> Those are common spellings of Fun Clicker.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4 border-none pt-4">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-400">Independent play page</p>
    <p class="text-xs font-medium leading-loose text-gray-500 max-w-2xl">
      FunClicker.click is not the game publisher. We provide an embedded play window and original help text. For tips
      and strategies, read the <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/guide/">guide</a>; for legal requests,
      use <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/contact">Contact</a> or
      <a class="underline font-black text-black" href="/dmca">DMCA</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
